Significance: minor
Type: added

Initializer: Add per-subsystem init methods (plugins action links, admin UI, REST API, licensing, Speed Score, ExPlat, JITM, Jetpack Manage) so consumers can initialize parts of My Jetpack individually, keep the my_jetpack_init action exclusive to init(), and set up Speed Score at most once per request regardless of how the init methods are combined. Add update_init_options() so a consumer can, before init() runs, register a skip list that excludes the licensing, Speed Score, ExPlat, JITM, and Jetpack Manage subsystems from init(); the REST API, admin UI, and plugins action links always boot, and the individual init methods ignore the skip list. Advertise the My Jetpack Add License screen only when the licensing REST endpoints are actually registered, so skipping the licensing subsystem does not surface a screen whose requests would 404.
